DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vvmmtt driver is a kernel level implementation of VMware Tools.  VMware
     Tools are intended to provide better support for operating systems run‐
     ning inside virtual machines.

     vvmmtt handles shutdown and reboot requests from the host by signalling
     init(8) with SIGUSR2 and SIGINT respectively.  vvmmtt will log notifications
     that the guest has been suspended or resumed by the host.  It also pro‐
     vides access to the host machine's clock as a timedelta sensor.

     vvmmtt reports the guest's hostname and all non-loopback IP addresses to the
     host.

